# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = Nightmare: No Mercy
---
In this version of the parlor the popsicles had stopped pretending to be dessert.

A single lick and it was over: no hearts, no second chances, and no apology from blue raspberry, who has never apologized for anything.

{name} survived by refusing to be delicious. It was a very near thing, and I will be lying down for the remainder of the chapter.
